{
  "app_id": 5375410,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Link Loop features seamless 2D portals that you need to use to reach the goal. Super satisfying physics with fluids and objects, that interact smoothly with your portals. Maps are purposefully unrestrictive. Be creative with your portals and find your own solution. Invite a friend to play online co-op through the campaign, or community made co-op levels. Powerful and very user-friendly. All the main levels are made in the level editor. Maps export easily as .json. Optimized for Steam-Deck. Includes right-stick aiming and adjustable keybinds. Key Features 50+ mind-bending solo puzzles. Co-op with 30+ additional puzzles. Powerful and user-friendly Level Editor. Virtually infinite levels with Steam Workshop. 100% Physics based: Crates, Lasers, Fluids and more! Steam Achievements."
  },
